  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3ff35790-aff7-4f71-9c2f-da70a7e7a60f",
    "name": "Arpegio Tienda",
    "description": "## Arpegio Tienda API\n\nThis collection covers the core REST API for **Arpegio Tienda**, a musical instrument e-commerce backend running on `localhost:8080`. It is organized into three functional modules:\n\n### Auth\nHandles user identity and access. Includes endpoints for **Sign Up** (new user registration) and **Login** (authentication), both targeting `/api/auth`.\n\n### Categories\nManages the product taxonomy. Provides full CRUD support for instrument categories via `/api/categories`:\n- Retrieve all categories or a single category by ID\n- Create new categories\n- Delete existing categories\n\n### Instruments\nManages the product catalog. Provides full CRUD support for instruments via `/api/instruments`:\n- Retrieve all instruments or a single instrument by ID\n- Filter instruments by category\n- Create, update, and delete instruments\n\n> **Base URL:** `http://localhost:8080`  \n> All endpoints follow RESTful conventions and are intended for local development use.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "43149589"
  },
